  "$id": "https://campuspath.invalid/schema/AdvisorSlot.json",
  "additionalProperties": false,
  "description": "Advisor 的一个可约时段。**只报占用，不报占用者**——\n名录对学生可见，谁约了谁不是学生该看到的。\n\nR8-1：``blocked=True`` 表示 Advisor 标记了\"此段不在\"——\n学生端名录**物理上看不到**这样的时段（服务端按角色过滤），\nAdvisor 工作台看得到并可随时解除。",
  "properties": {
    "advisor_id": {
      "maxLength": 128,
      "minLength": 1,
      "title": "Advisor Id",
      "type": "string"
    },
    "blocked": {
      "default": false,
      "title": "Blocked",
      "type": "boolean"
    },
    "booked": {
      "default": false,
      "title": "Booked",
      "type": "boolean"
    },
    "slot_id": {
      "maxLength": 128,
      "minLength": 1,
      "title": "Slot Id",
      "type": "string"
    },
    "span": {
      "$ref": "#/components/schemas/TimeRange"
    }
  },
  "required": [
    "slot_id",
    "advisor_id",
    "span"
  ],
  "title": "AdvisorSlot",
  "type": "object"
}
